            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This data builds on existing data to examine the long-term trends of the densities, population size structure, and mortality rates of abalone over a 32-year period within the Hopkins marine life refuge, a no-take marine reserve protected since 1931, and to examine temporal trends in populations in the absence of human take.",
